## Propose write in problem space jigsawdoku-sudoku when its conditions below hold.
sp {jigsawdoku-sudoku*propose*write
   (state <s> ^problem-space.name jigsawdoku-sudoku ^flags.mea-operator-selection true ^world <w> ^desireds <ds>)
   (<w> ^anchored-world true ^objects <objs>)
   (<objs> ^object <l> <n>)
   (<l> ^type location ^object-handle $ <lh>)
   (<n> ^type number ^number <k> ^object-handle $ <nh>)
